{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は日記です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "φ(．．)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobHeoszH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3rd TOURかな\nみんなで大きなハート作るの好きなの\n次はいつ作れるだろ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobroBZf2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "秘密だけど この日に結構思い入れがあってね\n集合写真の中で一番好きなんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobbdHOgB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの顔が見れるから円っていいよね\n手繋いでるの可愛い"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobVnA8wN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高校も、大学も、卒業おめでとうー！\n両立させるの本当に偉いとずっと思ってたよ\n限られた学生の時間をアイドルに捧げて\n大変なことなんていっぱいあるはずなのにね\nでも、りかにはずっとキラキラに見えてたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobajsVLX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ステージで写真撮れる時間は短いけど\nこれからも集まって撮りたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mob3r3tSR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ananさんに期別で撮っていただいたときの。\n三年前から成長して\nみんな綺麗になっちゃって。\nどんなメイクしててもどんな格好でも\nみんな本当に素敵なの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobhKKIfI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "若ーい！！！\nでもりかはきっとずっとみんなのこと\nこのままに見えちゃうんだろうな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobwOjKCE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "SHIBUYA TUTAYAさんに\nサインを書かせていただいた時の。\n6枚目シングルかな…？\n自撮りでぎゅうぎゅうかわいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobuDgTIo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静寂の暴力のミュージックビデオ撮影\n変わったポーズで集合写真撮るの好きなの！\nこのときは戦隊イメージ。\nなんだかんだこういうのやってくれるみんな優しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobNPNBOH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "背が高い組が後ろで頑張ってる。笑\n愛おしい無邪気な笑顔だなー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mob07z08Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このときはまだ恥ずかしくて\nステージでみんなのこと見れなかったな\n全曲一緒にステージ立つんだから\nもっと目見れば良かったななんて少しだけ思ったりもしてた\n今もまだ全然恥ずかしいけど\nリハーサルのときも、楽屋でも、本番も、\nもっとみんなのこと感じたかったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三期生は三周年を迎えました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前にお休みの日に\n11人で集まりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全然知らなくて\nケーキを見て、この集まりはこういうことか！と"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "覚えててくれてる子もだし\n会を計画してくれる子もだし\n準備してくれる子もだし\nなんだかんだ来てくれる子もだし\nプレートに書く言葉を 永久不滅☆ にする子もだし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛というやつかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は本当は\n複数人は得意じゃなくて\n1体1でのコミュニケーションを\n好んでしまうけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで同じ時間を過ごしたいって思うとき\n自分に時々びっくりする"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと出会って\n知らなかった自分とか感情に出会ったから\nたくさんのありがとうがある＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ三年で、もう三年で。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この先、私もみんなも\nたくさん変わっていくと思うけど\n近くに居たいし\nみんなで櫻坂46を支えられるようになりたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二期生さんのこと\n四期生ちゃんのこと\n三期生お互いのこと\nいっぱい見て、ずっと学び続けようね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと、りかね、家族写真を\n頻繁に撮る家庭で育ったからかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "集合写真が大好きなんだー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも撮りたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202604/mobbEzoNT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな、だいだいだいすきだよ"}], "source": "official"}